OL,3,GNEWSAFurther 210 homes planned next to
OL,4,Agarden village
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been lodged for 210 new
OL,7,Fhomes to be built on agricultural land
OL,8,Fnext to a huge new village.
OL,10,FBanks Property Ltd has applied to
OL,11,FDurham County Council for permission to
OL,12,Fbuild the development next to Seaham
OL,13,FGarden Village - a planned 1,500-home
OL,14,Festate with shops, green space and a
OL,15,Fschool.
OL,17,FPlanning documents show the Banks
OL,18,FProperty project would create a new
OL,19,Faccess road from the A182 roundabout to
OL,20,Fthe 14 hectare (34.6 acre) plot.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
